{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人鍾嘉欣圓18年終極夢想，宣布明年3月首踏紅館開個唱，網上隨即起哄，敲碗求邀林峯任嘉賓，兌現兩人的「紅館之約」。</p><p>有人歡喜有人愁，申請紅館檔期長達3年、入紙10次以上都失敗的謝安琪愈等愈傷心，不排除「天后降格」，考慮僅2千座位的「MK場」。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:44.744831+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T16:00:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.632999+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.632999+00:00","content_hash":"a40db42d17e269dbbfb205412469733bf6f695dd9f3a474ac1c1f30fdd666b6c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}